      "category": "bug",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "file_path": "internal/api/handler.go",
      "line_number": 63,
      "line_end": 63,
      "title": "Mutex left locked on missing key",
      "description": "Count locks h.mu before it checks the key. The empty-key branch then returns without unlocking h.mu. One request to GET /count without a key leaves h.mu locked for good. Every later Count request then blocks forever. Check the key before taking the lock. Alternatively, defer the unlock right after Lock.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": "semgrep:trailofbits.go.missing-unlock-before-return.missing-unlock-before-return",
      "candidate": "c2",
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "Count locks h.mu before it checks the key. The empty-key branch then returns without unlocking h.mu.",
      "consequence": "One request to GET /count without a key leaves h.mu locked for good. Every later Count request then blocks forever.",
      "fix": "Check the key before taking the lock. Alternatively, defer the unlock right after Lock."
    },
